Description:

Implements JMAP Object Metadata (draft-ietf-jmap-metadata-03): the
metadata and privateMetadata properties on Mailbox, Email, Calendar,
CalendarEvent, AddressBook, ContactCard and SieveScript, with their /get,
/set, /copy, /changes and /query extensions.


Documentation:

docsrc/rfc-support.rst


Config changes:

None


Upgrade instructions:

None.  Metadata is stored in the annotation
/vendor/cmu/cyrus-jmap/metadata, and counts against the
ANNOTATION-STORAGE quota.


